          ],
          "content": "andemg the covu ermomic, someviD-19 which chleters wespecial temperaould meaere used om a diature of asure th aistance, wperson those?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.777,
            0.534,
            0.869,
            0.577
          ],
          "content": "**Do you know?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.209,
            0.655,
            0.437,
            0.841
          ],
          "content": "",
